    <string name="field_note">Note</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">GeoStamp Camera is designed with privacy as a core principle.\n\nLocation data: We request camera and GPS access only to overlay location details onto photos you capture. Location is used in-app and is never uploaded to any developer server.\n\nPhotos: All captures and originals stay on your device, under your control. We never transmit your photos to our servers.\n\nExternal services: Reverse geocoding, map tiles and optional weather data require internet access. These third-party services receive only the coordinates necessary to answer the request.\n\nAdvertising: If AdMob is enabled, Google may collect device identifiers subject to their policies. You can disable personalized ads from Google settings.\n\nData deletion: Uninstalling the app removes all local data. You can also delete individual photos from the Gallery.\n\nContact: file an issue on the project page if you have questions.</string>
    <string name="help_body">Grant camera and location permissions, pick a template on the Camera screen, and tap the shutter. Your photo will be saved to the Gallery with the stamp applied.\n\nTemplates can be customised from the Templates screen. The Advance template exposes the most fields.\n\nIf GPS is unavailable, you can set a manual location from the Camera screen before capturing.</string>
